Third-Party Licenses
====================

The engine and MP4 WASM distributions include the following runtime dependency
license and notice texts. Package versions may have more than one supported
license; all supplied license texts below are retained. Build-only procedural
macros and test tools are outside this runtime inventory. The same aggregate
notice accompanies each WASM-carrying npm package.

The font stack uses released Fontations and HarfRust crates, including the
versions required internally by usvg. No vendored font parser is included.
The published woff2-patched codec remains a registry dependency. Caller-supplied
font licenses are the caller’s responsibility; no font is embedded in the engine
WASM. Repository fixture font notices are listed separately at the end.

